Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:21:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mlang: enumerator Clone, input/outbound encoding detection,
 IMLangConvertCharset, line breaking

- IEnumCodePage, IEnumRfc1766 and IEnumScript Clone copy the list and position
- DetectInputCodepage and DetectCodepageInIStream detect BOMs, ASCII, UTF-8 and Japanese encodings
- DetectOutboundCodePage and DetectOutboundCodePageInIStream follow the Wine test results (ASCII text gives
  UTF-8, UTF-7, UTF-16) and offer the preferred code pages that can represent non-ASCII text; the todo_wine marks
  that now pass are removed
- IMLangConvertCharset::DoConversion and GetProperty, ConvertStringReset, IMLangFontLink2::MapFont with no
  code pages (derived from the character), BreakLineW and BreakLineA break at white space

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

